  "goodToKnow": "Heiser means hoarse: heiser sein, eine heisere Stimme, sich heiser schreien (to shout oneself hoarse), as football fans do. Die Heiserkeit is hoarseness, often from a cold (Erkältung) or Kehlkopfentzündung (laryngitis). Synonyms: rau, krächzend, belegt. It's related to English hoarse. Don't confuse it with heiß (hot)."
